## Why This Is Asked

Tests expertise in geo-distributed, multi-tenant governance covering data residency requirements, cross-data center ordering guarantees, and traffic optimization under production load.

## Key Concepts

- Geo-distributed multi-tenant isolation and compliance
- Region-aware partitioning and leader election
- Cross-region replication throttling and causal ordering
- Canary rollout strategies and rollback mechanisms
- Compliance auditing and residency enforcement

## Code Example

```javascript
// Implementation sketch
class GeoPolicy {
  constructor(tenantRegionMap) { this.tenantRegionMap = tenantRegionMap; }

  getRegionsForTenant(tenantId) {
    return this.tenantRegionMap[tenantId] || ['default'];
  }

  enforceResidency(tenantId, targetRegion) {
    const allowedRegions = this.getRegionsForTenant(tenantId);
    return allowedRegions.includes(targetRegion);
  }
}
```

## Follow-up Questions

- How would you handle tenant region migrations with zero downtime?
- What monitoring metrics would you track for geo-replication health?
- How do you ensure consistency during network partitions?

